Package: darkfactory
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED@
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Depends: git
Recommends: xdg-utils
Homepage: https://github.com/Wintoplay/darkfactory
Description: local supervisor for coding agents in git worktrees
 DarkFactory runs coding agents in git worktrees, one PTY session per agent,
 and gives you a browser workspace to watch them: fleet, worktree, session
 and runs. It is a single static binary with no runtime dependencies, no
 telemetry and no auto-update.
 .
 Sessions live in a detached host, so they survive a daemon restart. Every
 mutation is decided by a policy file and recorded in a hash-chained ledger
 you can read with "darkfactory audit".
